---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Taehoon Kwon">
  <div>
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-medium">권태훈 (權泰勳)</h1>
    <address class="flex flex-col gap-2 not-italic text-sm">
      <a class="flex items-center gap-2" href="mailto:support@taehoonkwon.com">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 text-muted-foreground" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" /><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6" /></svg>
        <span>support@taehoonkwon.com</span>
      </a>
      <a class="flex items-center gap-2" href="https://www.threads.com/@theokwon_" rel="me">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 text-muted-foreground" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.1 3C7.2 3 4 6.6 4 12s3.2 9 8.1 9c4.5 0 7.5-2.7 7.5-6.7 0-3.6-2.5-6-6.4-6.2-.2-1.3-1-2-2.2-2-1.4 0-2.3.9-2.3 2.2h2c0-.4.1-.6.4-.6.5 0 .7.6.7 1.9-3.1.2-4.8 1.6-4.8 4 0 2.3 1.7 3.8 4.2 3.8 2.4 0 4.2-1.5 4.2-3.8 0-.2 0-.4-.1-.6 1.1.5 1.7 1.4 1.7 2.6 0 2.8-2 4.8-5.1 4.8-3.7 0-6.3-2.8-6.3-7.4s2.6-7.4 6.3-7.4c3.3 0 5.5 1.7 6 4.4h2C19.3 5.4 16.4 3 12.1 3Zm-.3 10.2c1.4 0 2.2.5 2.2 1.4 0 1-.8 1.7-2.2 1.7-1.4 0-2.2-.6-2.2-1.7 0-.9.8-1.4 2.2-1.4Z" /></svg>
        <span>theokwon_</span>
      </a>
    </address>
    <p class="mt-8 leading-relaxed">
      바다를 곁에 두고, 무언가를 만들며 행복하게 살고 있습니다.<br />
      책을 읽고, 글을 쓰며 생각을 나눕니다.<br /><br />

      저의 <a href="https://abit.ly/taehoon-bookshelf" class="text-primary">서재</a>를 둘러보세요.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
